I'll keep this extremely short.
Do I like Tree of Savior? Yes.
Is Tree of Savior Amazing? No.
Would I recommend Tree of Savior? That's a loaded question.
Pros -
)Phenomonal Music, and a wide variety at that.
)Enjoyable combat.
)Diverse class system. There are a lot of ways to build your character.
)HUGE WORLD
)Ragnarok Online 2 -- essentially.
)Technically speaking: It's a free game.
Cons -
)Community "has" been the most toxic and racist community I've seen... and I've seen a lot.
)Diverse class system. A single mistake can haunt you much further down the line.
)Completionists dream. There are quite the number of stat points you can get by doing quests... and there are a lot of quests. Not to mention, it's easy to lose track of said quests.
)Dungeon Group Finder System. Been in a party with no AoE CC/healer? Yeah, it kind of sucks and it happens a lot more than it should.
)Lack of character customization.*
*When it comes to Tree of Savior, a lot of us think back to RO (Ragnarok Online). When we think of RO, we think of highly customizable cosmetic appearances. We don't have that -- yet.

