As a huge fan of the Alien series... I totally recommend this game because it's everything (or almost) you'd want in a game based in the Alien franchise.
-The eery atmosphere and visuals completely faithful to the original Alien films (namely Alien 1 & 2);
-You can defend yourself up to a certain point and have to carefuly roam the corridors you walk, plan and manage the use of your resources;
-An original and lore-friendly story (despite it's cheesy ending that makes it look like that they were planning on milking this idea in case of success);
-Thrilling gameplay that will make your heart race almost at every corner;
-Plenty of spots to hide (because you'll really need them in this game)

