Enjoying it very much.
Here's my pro's & cons:
+ Devs listen to community, frequent updates;
+ Hacker prevention gets tighter each update;
+ Good amount of craftable items, look good as well;
+ Graphics are pretty. Not amazing, but pretty;
+ Add RP to a full server = Great gameplay;
- Combat is nowhere near finished: You can get killed by one single hit anywhere to the body, people hit you while you're blocking, people hit you with a melee wpn from yards away, ...
- Major bugs & glitches occur (But tolerable since it being in Alpha);
- Client crashes sometimes, causing everyone on the server to screenfreeze, sometimes with 5-min rollbacks;
- Character running speed / farming speed is waaay to slow. You have to run & grind for hours in a row before being able to settle down (& probably getting you killed over and over again in the process).
8/10 considering it's current state.

